I have  installed the memory and cpu yesterday and there is nothing to do =
except the lmfsetup to add the licence.

Usefull command to verify the installation:

at the console type :
 show cpu_enabled=20

if it returned to you f or ff or 3, you are OK, f or ff means that all =
