First of all, let me say this list is GOLD!  Thanks for all the help from
everyone.
 
This little description will help ingrain how new I actually am to Tru64
Unix....
 
Apparently, though I did a standard tru64 version 5 installation my 4DT40
video card did not get any drivers installed
Simple enough go get'em from Compaq.
 
Secondly after the install the Xserver could not start.  After a quick look
at /usr/var/X11/Xserver.conf (thanks to Lars Bro, Selden E Ball Jr, Jim
Belonis andKai Grunau)  There were two arguments that Xdec doesn't support,
after removing those and changing the entry to -pn -screen0 1024x768, 
then running /sbin/init.d/xlogin stop and 
then running /sbin/init.d/xlogin start all was good
 
Once again, you guys are great!  Thanks
 

