The RJ11 pins are numbered as follows:-

     ______
    |123456|
    |_    _|
      |__|

The signals are then:-

1 : Data Terminal Ready (DTR)
2 : Transmit Data (TXD)
3 : Ground
4 : Ground
5 : Receive Data (RXD)
6 : Data Set Ready (DSR)

Thanks to all who replied so quickly!

