Content-Type: text/plain;
	charset="ISO-8859-1"

All,

I was very surprised to find out that under TU5 you can actually grow a
logical volume and also extend the UFS file system on top of it. Very few
people realised this :-

To grow the logical volume :-

umount /kitting

volassist -f growby kitting 25m 

extendfs /dev/vol/rootdg/kitting 

mount -a

This extends /kitting by 25Mb.

Regards,
Mike.
