There were a couple of solutions offered. The first was to get truss off the
"Associated Products"
CD set ("Volume 2"). Since this CD seems not to have come with our V5.1
pack, the second solution was used. Thanks to Jason Orendorf  -- His
solution, and explanation follow:

Change trace.h - add the line:

#define _EXCEPTION_FRAME

to the top of the file.  Those register values are defined
in /usr/include/machine/reg.h.  5.1 put their definitions
inside an #ifdef.

