Subject: Summary: truss-like program for Tru64?
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=102653646721585


Many people responded. There were two solutions:

1) Several people supplied me with different versions of a program
   named "trace" for Alphas. It works somewhat, but the version I tried
   does not know about some system calls/functions. It generated several
   "unknown call ()" messages in its output stream.

2) The Tru64 UNIX 5.1 CDs contain truss. We don't have 5.1, but someone
   gave me a copy from his 5.1 system. It seems to work just fine.

Thanks to all for their help. There are lots of very helpfull members
of this mailing list!

rcf




