4.0F PK4 to 5.0A.  After that I received the following from Paul Henderson
of Compaq:

> This was a problem found in zinc (5.0A) where duplicate base os files
> were listed in the patch inventory files and update install treated
> them as obsolete files (qar 79657). Unfortunately, this bug was
> detected after zinc was closed. It was fixed in zulu (5.1).

