After placing a call a call with compaq. We found out that 4.0g patch kit
2 and presumably with 4.0f pk4 installs a new version of collect in
/usr/sbin which is incompatable with version 2.0 of collgui, as it writes
its data in a different format than collgui can read.  However if you use
the version of collect that was supplied with the collect setld which is
located in /usr/opt/col/bin/ will work ok with collgui.




